<title>UK: Merrill Lynch hires Kleinwort LatAm analyst.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch hires Kleinwort LatAm analyst.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment bank Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said on Wednesday it had hired an analyst from Dresdner Kleinwort Benson for its Latin American equity research team in New York.</p>
<p>A Merrill spokesman in London said Rene Kleyweg was going to join the New York team and would cover the Latin American mining industry.</p>
<p>He said Kleyweg was Latin American natural resources analyst at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, the investment banking arm of Germany's Dresdner Bank AG.</p>
<p>-- Alexander Smith, London newsroom +44 171 542 7719</p>
